          "content": "K = \\{ v \\in H ^ { 1 } ( \\Omega ) ; v - \\tilde { g } \\in H _ { 0 } ^ { 1 } ( \\Omega ) \\} ."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
